  {
   "slug": "home",
   "title": "We build what cities run on",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"anchor\":\"services\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"section-services\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div id=\"services\" class=\"wp-block-group alignfull section-services\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\"} --><p class=\"kicker\">What we build</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-title\">Services</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lead\"} --><p class=\"lead\">Commercial, industrial and civil work across the region, delivered by our own supervisors and self-performing crews.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"service-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group service-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"service-num\"} --><p class=\"service-num\">01</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">General contracting</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>One accountable team from groundbreaking to handover, with a fixed schedule and open-book costs.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:commercial}}\">Project updates &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"service-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group service-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"service-num\"} --><p class=\"service-num\">02</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Design-build</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Architects, engineers and builders under one contract. Faster decisions, fewer change orders.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:commercial}}\">Project updates &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"service-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group service-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"service-num\"} --><p class=\"service-num\">03</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Steel &amp; concrete</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our own crews for structural steel, post-tensioned slabs and precast erection.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:industrial}}\">Project updates &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"service-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group service-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"service-num\"} --><p class=\"service-num\">04</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Civil &amp; infrastructure</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Bridges, site works, utilities and roads for cities and transit agencies.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:infrastructure}}\">Project updates &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"section-numbers\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull section-numbers\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\"} --><p class=\"kicker\">Safety record</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-title\">The numbers we are proudest of</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"big-num\"} --><p class=\"big-num\">0.42</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Lost-time incident rate, a third of the industry average</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"big-num\"} --><p class=\"big-num\">1.9M</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Work hours in the last twelve months</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"big-num\"} --><p class=\"big-num\">100%</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Of site staff with current fall-protection training</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"big-num\"} --><p class=\"big-num\">38</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Years in business, family owned</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"anchor\":\"projects\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"section-projects\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div id=\"projects\" class=\"wp-block-group alignfull section-projects\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\"} --><p class=\"kicker\">Completed work</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-title\">Recent projects</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:tower}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"project-tile\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large project-tile\"><img src=\"{{media:tower}}\" alt=\"Harbourline Tower\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:tower}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Harbourline Tower</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"project-meta\"} --><p class=\"project-meta\">28 storeys · Commercial · 2025</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:bridge}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"project-tile\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large project-tile\"><img src=\"{{media:bridge}}\" alt=\"Millrace Crossing\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:bridge}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Millrace Crossing</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"project-meta\"} --><p class=\"project-meta\">Cable-stayed bridge · Civil · 2024</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:warehouse}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"project-tile\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large project-tile\"><img src=\"{{media:warehouse}}\" alt=\"Northgate Logistics Hub\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:warehouse}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Northgate Logistics Hub</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"project-meta\"} --><p class=\"project-meta\">42,000 m² · Industrial · 2025</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:projects}}\">All projects</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"section-careers\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull section-careers\"><!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":{{media_id:careers}},\"mediaType\":\"image\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"{{media:careers}}\" alt=\"A row of hard hats on pegs\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:careers}} size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\"} --><p class=\"kicker\">Careers</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Build a career, not just a building</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We hire apprentices every spring and promote from within: eleven of our fourteen superintendents started on our crews.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"check-list\"} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list check-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Paid apprenticeships in carpentry, ironwork and concrete</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Full benefits from the first day</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Safety training on company time</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:careers}}\">Open positions</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div><!-- /wp:media-text --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"section-updates\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull section-updates\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\"} --><p class=\"kicker\">From the site</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-title\">Project updates</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":3,\"displayPostDate\":true,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"columns\":3,\"displayPostContent\":true,\"excerptLength\":22} /--></div><!-- /wp:group -->",
