   "featured_media": "careers",
   "excerpt": "Twenty-two new apprentices joined our crews this summer. Four of them tell us why they chose the trades.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Twenty-two apprentices joined Ironbeam this summer, our largest intake yet. They will spend the next four years rotating between ironwork, carpentry and concrete, with one day a week at the technical college.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why the trades?</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>I wanted to see something I'd built when I drove home.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>First-year ironworker</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>No student debt, and I'm paid while I learn.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>First-year carpenter</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Applications for the 2027 class open in February. If you know someone who would be a good fit, send them to our careers page.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "sticky": false,
   "format": "standard",
