  {
   "slug": "northgate-hub-steel-complete",
   "title": "Northgate Logistics Hub: steel complete",
   "date": "2026-07-28T07:00:00",
   "categories": [
    "industrial"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "steel",
    "milestone"
   ],
   "featured_media": "warehouse",
   "excerpt": "The last of 4,200 tonnes of steel is up at the region's largest distribution centre.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The structural steel for the Northgate Logistics Hub is complete. The 42,000-square-metre building now has its full sawtooth roof frame, and roofing crews are working along the north lights.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Next steps</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} --><ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Roof cladding and north lights through August.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Slab-on-grade pours in nine sections.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Dock doors and levellers in October.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ol><!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The client will start racking installation in December, ahead of an opening in the new year.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The sawtooth north lights mean the floor will need artificial light for only a few hours on winter afternoons, cutting the building's energy use by a third.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "sticky": false,
   "format": "standard",
   "comments": []
  },
  {
   "slug": "night-work-and-neighbours",
   "title": "Night work and neighbours: how we keep the peace",
   "date": "2026-07-10T09:30:00",
   "categories": [
    "safety",
    "company-news"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "community"
   ],
   "featured_media": "excavator",
   "excerpt": "Building in a city means working around people's lives. These are the commitments we make to every neighbourhood.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Most of our projects are surrounded by homes, schools and businesses. Building there is a privilege, and it comes with obligations to the people who live next door.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our neighbourhood commitments</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"check-list\"} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list check-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>A named community liaison with a phone number on the hoarding.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Two weeks' notice of any night work or road closures.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Noise and dust monitors with public readings.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Clean streets at the end of every shift.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If something on one of our sites is bothering you, call the number on the fence. We would rather hear about it today than read about it next week.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Last year our liaison team answered 412 calls across five sites, and closed nine out of ten within a day.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "sticky": false,
   "format": "standard",
   "comments": []
  }
